    7 identity.set by identity-set.sh
=== a damaged log: identity-get and identity-set refuse, never "no identity" or "not picked"
$ sh main/identity-get.sh --effort <S>/space/efforts/<id>-identity --repo <S>/repo
    events-read.sh: <S>/space/efforts/<id>-identity/events/000007-identity.set.json cannot be read
    [exit 2]
$ sh main/identity-set.sh --effort <S>/space/efforts/<id>-identity --repo <S>/repo --list <S>/list.json
    events-read.sh: <S>/space/efforts/<id>-identity/events/000005-gate.answered.json cannot be read
    [exit 2]
    no event written
--- repaired
$ sh main/identity-get.sh --effort <S>/space/efforts/<id>-identity --repo <S>/repo
    {"repo":"<S>/repo","name":"Gpg Tester","email":"gpg@example.test","signing":{"format":"openpgp","key":"<KEYID>"},"fingerprint":"<FPR>"}
    [exit 0]
=== the events lock held: identity-set refuses with exit 6, nothing written; the rerun sets
$ sh main/identity-set.sh --effort <S>/space/efforts/<id>-locked --repo <S>/repo --list <S>/list.json
    event-write.sh: the events lock stayed held
    [exit 6]
    events before 2, after 2
$ sh main/identity-get.sh --effort <S>/space/efforts/<id>-locked --repo <S>/repo
    identity-get.sh: the effort has no identity for <S>/repo
    [exit 5]
$ sh main/identity-set.sh --effort <S>/space/efforts/<id>-locked --repo <S>/repo --list <S>/list.json
    <S>/space/efforts/<id>-locked/events/000003-identity.set.json
    [exit 0]
